    "text": "Lompoc Record\nwebsite\nSanta Maria\nFree US naturalization prep course available in Santa Maria\nBy Santa Maria Times Staff report,\n1 days agoThe Central Coast Literacy Council has launched a free U.S. Naturalization Preparation Course at St. Peter’s Episcopal Church in Santa Maria. The program began on July 17, and will run for six months, offering support to individuals preparing for the U.S. citizenship process. Held every Tuesday and Thursday from...",
